%%abc-alias Preston's 24 for 1804
%%abc-creator ABCexplorer 1.6.1 [07/02/2026]
%Transcribed into ABC Notation for the Village Music Project
% by Peter Dunk, 
%Feb 2025
Preston's 24 Country Dances
for the year 1804
with proper Tunes and Directions to each dance
as they are performed at
Court, Bath and Public Assemblies
London, printed and sold by Thos Preston
at his wholesale warehouse off ye Strand
where may be had
Budd's annual collection of 14 favourite Cotillions and Country Dances,
with their proper figures
adapted for the harpsichord or harp
humbly dedicated to the nobility and gentry

